upload_date.description:
Upload date filter.
Available options:
l - last hour;
t - today;
w - weak ago;
m - month ago;
y - year ago; (default: t)

sort.description:
Result sort. Available options:
r - relevance;
ra - rating;
u - upload date;
v - view count; (default: v)

features.description:
Video features.  Available options(could be joined by ';'):
h - hdr;
hd - hd;
s - subtitles;
c - cc;
3d - 3d;
3 - 360;
li - live;
lo - location;
4 - 4k;
 (default: li;hd)

duration.description:
Video duration. Available options:
s - short;
l - long; (default: s)

type.description:
Search type. Available options:
v - video;
c - channel;
p - playlist; (default: v)

